<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 189-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 189-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank said on Monday that the Treasury would auction 189-day T-bills on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Maturity: March 5, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom, +90-212-275 0875 SA</p>
</text>
